OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 17, arrested after sex attack
OL,4,Aon teenage girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of rape after two girls were
OL,8,Fattacked in a park.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said two
OL,11,F14-year-old girls got into conversation
OL,12,Fwith four males who they did not know
OL,13,Fin Florence Park, Oxford, on 28 July.
OL,15,FThe girls and two males then went to a
OL,16,Fwooded area of Marsh Park, where one
OL,17,Fmale raped one of the girls while the
OL,18,Fother sexually assaulted the second
OL,19,Fgirl, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
